h Pete about her mother Thipapa, who’s in prison, and her son Atom, whom everyone believes to be Pat’s son, before she’ll agree to their marriage, but unbeknownst to both Pete and Pat, Ran is hiding yet another secret: Pete’s cousin Tarit, who’s married to a sickly wife, is Ran’s ex-boyfriend and Atom’s father. To complicate matters, despite all their bickering, Pete and Pat find themselves falling for each other. (Source: Chobling)","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.5}],"value":7.5,"age":"R"},"current_season_id":7197,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}